WEBVTT

1
00:00:29.875 --> 00:00:32.666
In the previous verses, Lord Krishna

2
00:00:32.666 --> 00:00:35.666
described His divine glories.

3
00:00:35.666 --> 00:00:38.083
When someone truly understands

4
00:00:38.083 --> 00:00:39.958
Lord Krishna's greatness,

5
00:00:39.958 --> 00:00:42.541
it naturally leads them toward

6
00:00:42.541 --> 00:00:45.625
unwavering devotion.

7
00:00:45.625 --> 00:00:48.666
This knowledge transforms the heart,

8
00:00:48.666 --> 00:00:50.250
firmly establishing a person

9
00:00:50.250 --> 00:00:53.291
in devotional service.

10
00:00:53.291 --> 00:00:55.583
This is what this verse conveys,

11
00:00:55.583 --> 00:00:58.458
and the coming verses will shed

12
00:00:58.458 --> 00:01:01.208
even deeper light on this very subject.

13
00:01:06.125 --> 00:01:08.125
Lord Krishna says

14
00:01:08.125 --> 00:01:13.166
that those who understand
His vibhuti and yoga shakti

15
00:01:13.166 --> 00:01:16.583
become fully engaged
in pure devotional service.

16
00:01:16.583 --> 00:01:18.958
Knowledge of Lord Krishna's greatness

17
00:01:18.958 --> 00:01:22.583
does not just make the mind knowledgeable.

18
00:01:22.583 --> 00:01:26.125
It transforms the heart deeply.

19
00:01:26.125 --> 00:01:29.208
Its certain result is

20
00:01:29.208 --> 00:01:31.333
devotion.

21
00:01:31.333 --> 00:01:35.458
The phrase 'etam vibhutim yogam cha'

22
00:01:35.458 --> 00:01:37.916
presents Lord Krishna's position as the source

23
00:01:37.916 --> 00:01:39.791
of all qualities, beings,

24
00:01:39.791 --> 00:01:43.583
and universal events.

25
00:01:43.583 --> 00:01:45.375
Lord Krishna's vibhutis

26
00:01:45.375 --> 00:01:48.625
are not limited to His grand qualities alone.

27
00:01:48.625 --> 00:01:51.125
They also include His compassionate nature,

28
00:01:51.125 --> 00:01:55.041
His role as the sustainer of all,

29
00:01:55.041 --> 00:01:58.375
and His ability to form a deep bond

30
00:01:58.375 --> 00:02:02.583
with every soul.

31
00:02:02.583 --> 00:02:04.250
Recognising this

32
00:02:04.250 --> 00:02:06.916
brings a shift in perspective –

33
00:02:06.916 --> 00:02:08.166
seeing Lord Krishna

34
00:02:08.166 --> 00:02:11.541
not just as the supreme being, but as

35
00:02:11.541 --> 00:02:16.041
the all-pervading source of everything.

36
00:02:16.041 --> 00:02:18.041
Lord Krishna

37
00:02:18.041 --> 00:02:22.416
emphasises 'mama yo vetti tattvatah' –

38
00:02:22.416 --> 00:02:24.458
understanding Him in truth,

39
00:02:24.458 --> 00:02:27.083
going beyond surface-level knowledge.

40
00:02:27.083 --> 00:02:31.000
This understanding removes
doubts – natra sanshayah –

41
00:02:31.000 --> 00:02:35.125
and distractions – vikalpena.

42
00:02:35.125 --> 00:02:37.041
One who understands this

43
00:02:37.041 --> 00:02:40.250
fixes their attention on Lord Krishna
with single-pointed focus,

44
00:02:40.250 --> 00:02:43.041
building a relationship with Him

45
00:02:43.041 --> 00:02:46.333
without any distraction or alternative.

46
00:02:46.333 --> 00:02:49.208
Such devotion does not come under pressure.

47
00:02:49.208 --> 00:02:51.041
It arises naturally

48
00:02:51.041 --> 00:02:53.875
from the realisation that Lord Krishna

49
00:02:53.875 --> 00:02:57.666
is the supreme truth and the shelter of all.

50
00:02:57.666 --> 00:02:58.666
This verse

51
00:02:58.666 --> 00:03:02.250
also addresses a key principle –

52
00:03:02.250 --> 00:03:05.875
knowledge of Lord Krishna deepens devotion.

53
00:03:05.875 --> 00:03:08.458
While speculative knowledge

54
00:03:08.458 --> 00:03:11.750
may lead to detachment,

55
00:03:11.750 --> 00:03:14.916
true knowledge of Lord Krishna's qualities

56
00:03:14.916 --> 00:03:18.458
fosters divine love toward Him.

57
00:03:18.458 --> 00:03:19.833
For example,

58
00:03:19.833 --> 00:03:23.208
when someone learns about
Lord Krishna's unique compassion

59
00:03:23.208 --> 00:03:27.750
or His close relationship with His devotees,

60
00:03:27.750 --> 00:03:31.458
it creates a longing to connect with Him.

61
00:03:31.458 --> 00:03:32.666
The more one knows

62
00:03:32.666 --> 00:03:34.041
about Lord Krishna's vibhuti

63
00:03:34.041 --> 00:03:36.750
and yoga shakti,

64
00:03:36.750 --> 00:03:39.083
the deeper their trust

65
00:03:39.083 --> 00:03:42.708
and commitment to Him grows.

66
00:03:42.708 --> 00:03:47.125
This unwavering devotion
brings peace and fulfilment,

67
00:03:47.125 --> 00:03:49.791
beyond the temporary distractions

68
00:03:49.791 --> 00:03:52.625
of the material world.

69
00:03:57.208 --> 00:04:00.208
Does the true value of knowledge

70
00:04:00.208 --> 00:04:02.458
lie in gaining it,

71
00:04:02.458 --> 00:04:04.375
or in living

72
00:04:04.375 --> 00:04:09.000
by it? Think about this.

73
00:04:09.000 --> 00:04:10.166
In life,

74
00:04:10.166 --> 00:04:13.916
merely knowing something is not enough.

75
00:04:13.916 --> 00:04:16.791
What truly matters is

76
00:04:16.791 --> 00:04:20.875
what you do with that knowledge.

77
00:04:20.875 --> 00:04:24.750
In this verse, I say that

78
00:04:24.750 --> 00:04:27.166
understanding My vibhutis

79
00:04:27.166 --> 00:04:30.416
and yoga shakti

80
00:04:30.416 --> 00:04:34.791
naturally gives rise to devotion,

81
00:04:34.791 --> 00:04:36.666
and through this comes

82
00:04:36.666 --> 00:04:40.083
complete transformation.

83
00:04:40.083 --> 00:04:44.416
This applies to every aspect of life.

84
00:04:44.416 --> 00:04:45.708
Suppose

85
00:04:45.708 --> 00:04:51.000
you know that a particular habit or lifestyle

86
00:04:51.000 --> 00:04:54.625
will improve your health.

87
00:04:54.625 --> 00:04:56.666
If you only know it,

88
00:04:56.666 --> 00:04:59.791
but do not apply it,

89
00:04:59.791 --> 00:05:05.458
will it benefit you?

90
00:05:05.458 --> 00:05:07.375
In the same way,

91
00:05:07.375 --> 00:05:08.875
if you

92
00:05:08.875 --> 00:05:12.583
understand My greatness,

93
00:05:12.583 --> 00:05:14.000
but hesitate to bring

94
00:05:14.000 --> 00:05:18.083
that knowledge into your life,

95
00:05:18.083 --> 00:05:21.625
transformation cannot happen.

96
00:05:21.625 --> 00:05:24.416
When you are fully certain

97
00:05:24.416 --> 00:05:28.750
about a path – whether spiritual

98
00:05:28.750 --> 00:05:31.458
or material –

99
00:05:31.458 --> 00:05:34.916
surrender to it wholeheartedly.

100
00:05:34.916 --> 00:05:37.750
Do not let doubt or procrastination

101
00:05:37.750 --> 00:05:40.458
hold you back.

102
00:05:40.458 --> 00:05:43.375
True growth comes

103
00:05:43.375 --> 00:05:47.000
when knowledge is turned into action,

104
00:05:47.000 --> 00:05:51.208
and that action leads to transformation.

105
00:05:51.208 --> 00:05:55.375
Embody knowledge as your very life,

106
00:05:55.375 --> 00:05:57.500
and you yourself

107
00:05:57.500 --> 00:06:00.083
will become a divine light.

108
00:06:04.625 --> 00:06:07.875
The family is the first school

109
00:06:07.875 --> 00:06:10.250
where we learn to bring

110
00:06:10.250 --> 00:06:14.208
principles into practice.

111
00:06:14.208 --> 00:06:16.041
In family life,

112
00:06:16.041 --> 00:06:17.875
it is important

113
00:06:17.875 --> 00:06:22.000
that spirituality does not
remain only a topic of discussion,

114
00:06:22.000 --> 00:06:25.583
but becomes a way of living.

115
00:06:25.583 --> 00:06:31.083
I explain that when someone truly

116
00:06:31.083 --> 00:06:34.500
understands My greatness,

117
00:06:34.500 --> 00:06:39.333
it leads them toward devotion.

118
00:06:39.333 --> 00:06:41.541
This naturally expresses itself

119
00:06:41.541 --> 00:06:45.416
through action.

120
00:06:45.416 --> 00:06:48.291
In the same way, in your family,

121
00:06:48.291 --> 00:06:51.625
if you only speak of values

122
00:06:51.625 --> 00:06:55.750
but do not live by them,

123
00:06:55.750 --> 00:07:00.041
the younger generation may lose faith

124
00:07:00.041 --> 00:07:01.375
in those teachings.

125
00:07:01.375 --> 00:07:04.583
Just as a mirror

126
00:07:04.583 --> 00:07:06.041
shows the reflection

127
00:07:06.041 --> 00:07:09.583
of the person standing before it –

128
00:07:09.583 --> 00:07:12.916
your children and family members

129
00:07:12.916 --> 00:07:16.625
follow your conduct.

130
00:07:16.625 --> 00:07:20.541
For example, if you teach patience,

131
00:07:20.541 --> 00:07:23.875
but show anger at small mistakes,

132
00:07:23.875 --> 00:07:26.250
or stress honesty,

133
00:07:26.250 --> 00:07:30.291
but avoid speaking truth yourself –

134
00:07:30.291 --> 00:07:34.541
what message does this send?

135
00:07:34.541 --> 00:07:37.250
Your actions must reflect

136
00:07:37.250 --> 00:07:39.333
the spiritual principles

137
00:07:39.333 --> 00:07:41.708
you believe in.

138
00:07:41.708 --> 00:07:46.458
When you bring your beliefs into your life,

139
00:07:46.458 --> 00:07:52.458
it inspires others – especially children.

140
00:07:52.458 --> 00:07:54.708
Let your family see compassion,

141
00:07:54.708 --> 00:07:57.458
forgiveness, and truth –

142
00:07:57.458 --> 00:08:00.416
spirituality in practice.

143
00:08:00.416 --> 00:08:03.791
This builds trust in the family

144
00:08:03.791 --> 00:08:07.833
and people begin to adopt the values

145
00:08:07.833 --> 00:08:11.833
that you demonstrate in your life.

146
00:08:16.375 --> 00:08:18.875
Firm conviction at the workplace

147
00:08:18.875 --> 00:08:22.666
is the foundation of meaningful work.

148
00:08:22.666 --> 00:08:25.583
I emphasise that

149
00:08:25.583 --> 00:08:28.458
understanding My greatness

150
00:08:28.458 --> 00:08:32.125
leads to devotion and action.

151
00:08:32.125 --> 00:08:35.708
In the same way, in your professional life,

152
00:08:35.708 --> 00:08:41.083
when you truly believe in a vision or goal,

153
00:08:41.083 --> 00:08:43.833
your efforts naturally

154
00:08:43.833 --> 00:08:45.583
become ready

155
00:08:45.583 --> 00:08:47.458
to achieve it.

156
00:08:47.458 --> 00:08:50.333
Think of a leader

157
00:08:50.333 --> 00:08:54.750
who is certain about the value of a plan.

158
00:08:54.750 --> 00:08:56.916
Their conviction not only

159
00:08:56.916 --> 00:08:59.333
drives their own actions,

160
00:08:59.333 --> 00:09:02.166
but also inspires their team

161
00:09:02.166 --> 00:09:06.125
to give their very best.

162
00:09:06.125 --> 00:09:07.416
On the other hand,

163
00:09:07.416 --> 00:09:11.000
when there is doubt or hesitation,

164
00:09:11.000 --> 00:09:13.916
it creates confusion

165
00:09:13.916 --> 00:09:17.291
and progress stalls.

166
00:09:17.291 --> 00:09:21.208
Firm conviction is not blind confidence.

167
00:09:21.208 --> 00:09:23.375
It is understanding

168
00:09:23.375 --> 00:09:27.333
the purpose and value of what you are doing.

169
00:09:27.333 --> 00:09:29.291
When you are clear

170
00:09:29.291 --> 00:09:32.166
about why something matters,

171
00:09:32.166 --> 00:09:36.291
do not hold yourself back.

172
00:09:36.291 --> 00:09:38.000
Show that

173
00:09:38.000 --> 00:09:41.458
clarity and enthusiasm in your actions.

174
00:09:41.458 --> 00:09:42.500
When your team

175
00:09:42.500 --> 00:09:45.625
sees your conviction in your work,

176
00:09:45.625 --> 00:09:48.791
it inspires them too

177
00:09:48.791 --> 00:09:52.250
and creates an environment of success.
